# Deny-all, then allow exactly what the image needs. The model is bind-mounted at
# /model by the judge, never baked in -- keeping hf-model/ (5.9 GB) out of the
# build context matters.
*
!pyproject.toml
!setup.py
!README.md
!vtl/
# Vendored official FA3 (python wrapper + CUDA sources + CUTLASS headers); setup.py
# compiles it into flash_attn_3._C. Without this the COPY in the Dockerfile can't find it.
!flash_attn_3/
!docker/cache/
# Warm-up trace slice (bind-mounted + head -n during build; parents must be re-included too).
!data
!data/input
!data/input/trace-round1.jsonl
